---
layout: default
title: "Robots that take batteries apart"
description: "Rose City Robotics is a battery recycling research company in Portland, Oregon. We build robotic systems — trained by expert technicians — that disassemble end-of-life EV battery packs, recovering more value than shredding."
permalink: /
---

<!-- Hero -->
<div class="py-16 sm:py-24">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 lg:px-8">
    <p class="eyebrow text-primary-600 mb-6">Rose City Robotics · Portland, Oregon</p>
    <h1 class="text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-8xl">
      <span class="block">Robots that take</span>
      <span class="block">batteries apart.</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-8 text-xl leading-8 text-gray-900 max-w-2xl">We're a battery recycling research company. We build robotic systems — trained by expert human technicians — that disassemble end-of-life EV battery packs: recovering more value than shredding, without putting people next to high-voltage fire risks.</p>
    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-3 items-center">
      <a href="mailto:hello@rosecityrobotics.com?subject=Partnership" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Partner with us</a>
      <a href="/technology/" class="text-sm font-semibold leading-6 text-gray-900">See the technology <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      <a href="/articles/" class="text-sm font-semibold leading-6 text-gray-900">Read the research <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Award banner -->
<div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 lg:px-8">
  <a href="/articles/rose-city-robotics-wins-doe-lithium-ion-battery-recycling-prize-breakthrough-contest/" class="block rounded-xl border-l-4 border-golden-yellow-500 bg-golden-yellow-50 p-6 transition hover:bg-golden-yellow-100">
    <p class="text-base font-medium text-gray-900">
      <span class="font-bold">Winner</span> — U.S. Department of Energy Lithium-Ion Battery Recycling Prize, Breakthrough Contest: a $200,000 award, advancing to Phase IV.
      <span class="whitespace-nowrap text-primary-700">Read the announcement <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
    </p>
  </a>
</div>

<!-- Today vs With RCR -->
<section class="bg-gray-50 py-20 mt-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12">
    <div class="border-t-2 border-gray-300 pt-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-500">Today</h2>
      <p class="mt-1 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900">Shred it, or risk someone.</p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-gray-600">Recyclers face a bad tradeoff. Manual disassembly recovers the most value but puts technicians next to thermal-runaway fires and lethal voltage. Whole-pack shredding is safer for people and scales — but it burns energy, consumes chemicals, and grinds reusable modules into lower-value feedstock.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="border-t-2 border-primary-600 pt-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-primary-600">With RCR</h2>
      <p class="mt-1 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900">Disassemble first. Recover more.</p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-gray-600">Our robots are trained by expert technicians through teleoperation, then run autonomously. Packs come apart into modules, cells, and components — sorted for second life or recycling. Cleaner feedstock, lower transport costs per pound of critical material, and no human inside the hazard zone.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Numbers band -->
<section class="py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6">
    <dl class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 sm:grid-cols-3 text-center">
      <% [
        [">90%", "the DOE recovery-rate goal our system is built for"],
        ["~80%", "typical remaining capacity in an end-of-life EV battery"],
        ["20M tons", "projected annual EV battery waste by 2040"],
      ].each do |stat, label| %>
        <div class="flex flex-col">
          <dt class="text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-primary-600"><%= stat %></dt>
          <dd class="mt-3 text-base leading-7 text-gray-600"><%= label %></dd>
        </div>
      <% end %>
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Media -->
<section class="pb-8">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6">
    <img src="<%= relative_url('/images/glovebox_dissection.png') %>" alt="A robot disassembling a battery pack inside an isolated glovebox" class="aspect-[16/9] w-full rounded-2xl bg-gray-100 object-cover" />
  </div>
</section>

<!-- How it works -->
<section class="py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl lg:mx-0">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-4xl">How it works</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="mx-auto mt-16 max-w-2xl lg:mx-0 lg:max-w-none">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 lg:grid-cols-3">
        <% [
          ["1", "Teleoperate", "An expert technician disassembles the pack remotely. The battery sits in an isolated, nitrogen-blanketed cell; the human never gets near it."],
          ["2", "Learn", "Every teardown is training data. Transformer neural networks — the ALOHA/ACT lineage from Stanford — learn disassembly skills from human demonstrations, no per-pack programming."],
          ["3", "Run autonomously", "The robot works packs on its own. When it hits something novel, a human takes over, finishes the job, and the robot learns from the intervention."],
        ].each do |num, title, body| %>
          <div class="relative rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-8">
            <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary-500 text-white text-xl font-bold"><%= num %></div>
            <h3 class="mt-6 text-lg font-semibold leading-8 tracking-tight text-gray-900"><%= title %></h3>
            <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-gray-600"><%= body %></p>
          </div>
        <% end %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Partners -->
<section class="bg-gray-50 py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-3xl">Developed with partners across the battery value chain</h2>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-gray-600">Our DOE prize application was built with Oak Ridge National Laboratory (evaluation partner), Cirba Solutions, American Battery Technologies, Ecobat, Daimler Trucks NA, Orange EV, Navistar, Lico Materials, Polaris Battery Labs, Loupe Robotics, and Portland State University.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Latest articles -->
<% latest_articles = collections.articles.resources.reject { |a| a.data.unlisted }.first(3) %>
<% if latest_articles.any? %>
  <section class="mt-24 mb-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl lg:mx-0">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-4xl">From the lab</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-lg leading-8 text-gray-600">Research notes, disassembly experiments, and company news.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mx-auto mt-12 grid max-w-2xl grid-cols-1 gap-x-8 gap-y-12 lg:mx-0 lg:max-w-none lg:grid-cols-3">
        <% latest_articles.each do |article| %>
          <article class="flex flex-col">
            <% if article.data.image %>
              <img src="<%= relative_url(article.data.image) %>" alt="" class="aspect-[16/9] w-full rounded-2xl bg-gray-100 object-cover" />
            <% end %>
            <div class="mt-6">
              <% if article.data.published_at %>
                <time class="text-xs text-gray-500" datetime="<%= article.data.published_at %>">
                  <%= Date.parse(article.data.published_at.to_s).strftime("%B %-d, %Y") %>
                </time>
              <% end %>
              <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">
                <a href="<%= article.relative_url %>" class="hover:text-primary-600"><%= article.data.title %></a>
              </h3>
              <% if article.data.meta_description %>
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-600"><%= article.data.meta_description %></p>
              <% end %>
            </div>
          </article>
        <% end %>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-10">
        <a href="/articles/" class="btn btn-link px-0">All articles <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
<% end %>
